# Store and check out every text file with LF line endings, on every OS.
# This matches Prettier's "endOfLine": "lf" and the Linux machines that
# GitHub Actions and Render run on. Without it, Git on Windows converts files
# to CRLF on checkout and `npm run format:check` would flag every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.heic binary
